  characterName: Kishida Mie
  description: She's a bit of a perv and while she likes to act aloof on her own,
    she's more perceptive than people think, though it has led her to be rather antisocial.
    Drawn in by her passion for (adult) books, Takasu Mitsuko would approach her
    with the intention of becoming friends, regardless of how many times she would
    get turned down. Through their bond, they learn to become more open about themselves.
